{"games":[{"display_name":"準々決勝 - 第 1 試合","duration_seconds":900,"game_id":8,"game_type":"1v1","is_public":true,"main_players":[{"display_name":"kagaffy","icon_path":"files/img/kagaffy/icon.jpg","is_admin":false,"label":"ベスト4","user_id":13,"username":"kagaffy"},{"display_name":"KeisukeSakata","icon_path":"files/img/KeisukeSakata/icon.png","is_admin":false,"label":"ベスト6","user_id":17,"username":"KeisukeSakata"}],"problem":{"description":"『99 Bottles of Beer』の歌詞を 99 本から 0 本まで出力してください。\r\n歌詞の内容は「99 Bottles of Beer」で検索するか、サンプルコードを参照してください。\r\nそれぞれの節の間には空行を挿入してください。","language":"swift","problem_id":5,"sample_code":"func bottleCountText(_ count: Int) -> String {\r\n    switch count {\r\n    case 0:\r\n        return \"no more bottles\"\r\n    case 1:\r\n        return \"1 bottle\"\r\n    default:\r\n        return \"\\(count) bottles\"\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunc printVerse(startingBottles: Int) {\r\n    let currentBottles = bottleCountText(startingBottles)\r\n    let nextBottles = bottleCountText(startingBottles - 1)\r\n    \r\n    let firstLine = \"\\(currentBottles.prefix(1).uppercased())\\(currentBottles.dropFirst()) of beer on the wall, \\(currentBottles) of beer.\"\r\n    \r\n    if startingBottles > 0 {\r\n        print(firstLine)\r\n        print(\"Take one down and pass it around, \\(nextBottles) of beer on the wall.\")\r\n    } else {\r\n        print(firstLine)\r\n        print(\"Go to the store and buy some more, 99 bottles of beer on the wall.\")\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfor bottleCount in (0...99).reversed() {\r\n    printVerse(startingBottles: bottleCount)\r\n    if bottleCount > 0 {\r\n        print()\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n","title":"99 Bottles of Beer","sample_code_html":"<pre class=\"shiki github-light\" style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> bottleCountText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">    switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> count {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> \"no more bottles\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> \"1 bottle\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">    default:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\\(count)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> bottles\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> printVerse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">startingBottles</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> currentBottles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> bottleCountText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(startingBottles)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> nextBottles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> bottleCountText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(startingBottles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> firstLine </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\\(currentBottles.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">prefix</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">).</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">uppercased</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">())\\(currentBottles.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">dropFirst</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">())</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> of beer on the wall, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\\(currentBottles)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> of beer.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> startingBottles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(firstLine)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"Take one down and pass it around, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\\(nextBottles)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> of beer on the wall.\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(firstLine)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"Go to the store and buy some more, 99 bottles of beer on the wall.\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> bottleCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">...</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">99</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">).</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">reversed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">    printVerse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">startingBottles</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">: bottleCount)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> bottleCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}</span></span></code></pre>"},"started_at":1758269003},{"display_name":"準々決勝 - 第 2 試合","duration_seconds":900,"game_id":9,"game_type":"1v1","is_public":true,"main_players":[{"display_name":"log5","icon_path":"files/img/log5/icon.jpg","is_admin":false,"label":"ベスト4","user_id":9,"username":"log5"},{"display_name":"WorldDownTown","icon_path":"files/img/WorldDownTown/icon.jpg","is_admin":false,"label":"ベスト6","user_id":19,"username":"WorldDownTown"}],"problem":{"description":"先日 9 月 13 日は「プログラマーの日」でした。\r\nこれは、1 月 1 日を 1 日目として 2 の 8 乗日目であることに由来します。\r\n1970 年から今年までのプログラマーの日を、YYYY-MM-DD の形式で全て出力してください (改行区切り)。\r\nなお、その当時にプログラマーの日という概念があったかどうかは無視し、今と同じルールで算出するものとします。\r\n閏年に注意してください。\r\nなお、実行環境の制約上 Foundation の import はできません。Calendar 等の API は使用不可能です。","language":"swift","problem_id":10,"sample_code":"let startYear = 1970\r\nlet currentYear = 2025\r\n\r\nfor year in startYear...currentYear {\r\n    let isLeapYear = (year % 4 == 0 && year % 100 != 0) || (year % 400 == 0)\r\n    let month = 9\r\n    let day = isLeapYear ? 12 : 13\r\n    let monthFormatted = month < 10 ? \"0\\(month)\" : \"\\(month)\"\r\n    let dayFormatted = day < 10 ? \"0\\(day)\" : \"\\(day)\"\r\n    print(\"\\(year)-\\(monthFormatted)-\\(dayFormatted)\")\r\n}\r\n","title":"Programmer's Day","sample_code_html":"<pre class=\"shiki github-light\" style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> startYear </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 1970</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> currentYear </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 2025</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> year </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> startYear</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">currentYear {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> isLeapYear </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> (year </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> year </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> !=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> (year </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 400</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> month </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> day </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> isLeapYear </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 12</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 13</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> monthFormatted </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> month </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> \"0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\\(month)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\\(month)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> dayFormatted </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> day </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> \"0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\\(day)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\\(day)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\\(year)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">-</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\\(monthFormatted)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">-</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\\(dayFormatted)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}</span></span></code></pre>"},"started_at":1758270662},{"display_name":"準決勝 - 第 1 試合","duration_seconds":900,"game_id":10,"game_type":"1v1","is_public":true,"main_players":[{"display_name":"kntkymt","icon_path":"files/img/kntkymt/icon.jpg","is_admin":false,"label":"優勝","user_id":10,"username":"kntkymt"},{"display_name":"kagaffy","icon_path":"files/img/kagaffy/icon.jpg","is_admin":false,"label":"ベスト4","user_id":13,"username":"kagaffy"}],"problem":{"description":"標準入力の各行に、英字のみからなる文字列が与えられます。\r\nキャメルケースをスネークケースに変換し、改行区切りで出力してください。\r\n出力するスネークケースは常に小文字とします。\r\nなお、キャメルケースとは、variableNameLikeThis や ClassNameLikeThis のような文字列を指します。\r\nまた、スネークケースとは、variable_name_like_this や class_name_like_this のような文字列を指します。\r\nこの変換は、「先頭以外の英大文字」を「アンダースコア」+「元の大文字を小文字に変換した文字」で置き換えることで実現できます。\r\n頭字語を考慮する必要はありません。つまり、\"XML\" は \"x_m_l\" になります。","language":"swift","problem_id":9,"sample_code":"func convertCamelCaseToSnakeCase(_ input: String) -> String {\r\n    var result = \"\"\r\n\r\n    for (index, character) in input.enumerated() {\r\n        if character.isUppercase && index > 0 {\r\n            result.append(\"_\")\r\n            result.append(character.lowercased())\r\n        } else {\r\n            result.append(character.lowercased())\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    return result\r\n}\r\n\r\nwhile let line = readLine() {\r\n    print(convertCamelCaseToSnakeCase(line))\r\n}\r\n","title":"i_love_snake_case","sample_code_html":"<pre class=\"shiki github-light\" style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> convertCamelCaseToSnakeCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> input: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> (index, character) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> input.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">enumerated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> character.isUppercase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> index </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">            result.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"_\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">            result.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(character.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">lowercased</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">            result.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(character.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">lowercased</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">while</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> line </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> readLine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">convertCamelCaseToSnakeCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(line))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}</span></span></code></pre>"},"started_at":1758272501},{"display_name":"準決勝 - 第 2 試合","duration_seconds":1200,"game_id":11,"game_type":"1v1","is_public":true,"main_players":[{"display_name":"log5","icon_path":"files/img/log5/icon.jpg","is_admin":false,"label":"ベスト4","user_id":9,"username":"log5"},{"display_name":"kazuya","icon_path":"files/img/kazuya/icon.jpg","is_admin":false,"label":"準優勝","user_id":14,"username":"kazuya"}],"problem":{"description":"標準入力の各行に、1 から 2147483647 までの整数が与えられます。\r\n1 GiB 以上なら \" GiB\" を、1 MiB 以上なら \" MiB\" を、1 KiB 以上なら \" KiB\" を、いずれでもなければ \" B\" を単位として用いて、有効数字 1 桁 (2 桁目以降切り捨て) で表示してください。\r\n「123」なら「100 B」、「2345」なら「2 KiB」、「98765432」なら「90 MiB」を出力します。\r\n出力は改行区切りでおこない、単位と数字の間にはスペースを一つ挿入してください。\r\nなお、1 KiB、1 MiB、1 GiB はそれぞれ 1024 B、1024 KiB、1024 MiB です。","language":"swift","problem_id":8,"sample_code":"let units = [\r\n    (threshold: 1024*1024*1024, name: \"GiB\"),\r\n    (threshold: 1024*1024, name: \"MiB\"),\r\n    (threshold: 1024, name: \"KiB\"),\r\n    (threshold: 1, name: \"B\")\r\n]\r\n\r\nfunc formatBytes(_ bytes: Int) -> String {\r\n    let unit = units.first(where: { bytes >= $0.threshold })!\r\n    let value = bytes / unit.threshold\r\n    let significantDigit = extractMostSignificantDigit(from: value)\r\n\r\n    return \"\\(significantDigit) \\(unit.name)\"\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunc extractMostSignificantDigit(from number: Int) -> Int {\r\n    var highestPowerOfTen = 1\r\n    var temporary = number\r\n\r\n    while temporary >= 10 {\r\n        temporary /= 10\r\n        highestPowerOfTen *= 10\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    return temporary * highestPowerOfTen\r\n}\r\n\r\nwhile let line = readLine() {\r\n    if let bytes = Int(line) {\r\n        print(formatBytes(bytes))\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n","title":"Human-friendly Units","sample_code_html":"<pre class=\"shiki github-light\" style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> units </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"